 "description": "<p>Laser-finish patent leather in a three-piece set: jumpsuit, leather socks, and headwear, with a waist range of 60-88 cm and hip range of 65-90 cm, suited to 40-55 kg. The laser finish shifts color under light the way flat patent cannot.</p>\n<p>Leather socks included in the set solve the usual matching problem - finding hosiery that matches a specialty finish is its own project. The headwear closes the silhouette.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: patent leather, laser finish</li>\n<li>Includes: jumpsuit, leather socks, headwear</li>\n<li>Style: laser, one-piece</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, waist 60-88 cm, hips 65-90 cm, 40-55 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Check the waist and hip ranges before ordering - patent leather stretches less than any fabric in this category.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Laser patent leather one-piece with jumpsuit, leather socks and headwear, waist 60-88 cm for 40-55 kg.</p>\n",
